{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_37F6F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，Metal Gear<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>的调整已经完成。\n现在随时都能出击。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"是吗，谢谢。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":19,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不用谢。这样总算真的能帮上你的忙了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":55,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"也可以让它出击<R=『OUTER OPS』,OUTER OPS>。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=『OUTER OPS』,OUTER OPS>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这种情况下，只要在编组部队时\n选择<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>就行。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"也为了进行实地测试，一定要试着用用它。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"知道了。我会记住的。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"另外，和之前一样，也可以更换武器、\n查看记忆板之类的东西。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"看看实地测试的情况，\n再根据需要进行调整吧。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"是啊。这还不代表一切都结束了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":""}]}